Determine the necessary gender combinations for the remaining $3$ performers to satisfy Ami's requirement of more males than females overall:
$$\begin{aligned}
\text{Option 1: } 3 \text{M, } 2 \text{F overall} & \implies \text{choose } 2 \text{ additional males and } 1 \text{ additional female} \\
\text{Option 2: } 4 \text{M, } 1 \text{F overall} & \implies \text{choose } 3 \text{ additional males and } 0 \text{ additional females}
\end{aligned}$$
(Note: $5$ males overall is not possible because Mrs Blake is already included).
